page gatekeeper/30576.htm
page script/quest/Q009_IntoTheCityOfHumans/
npc petukai 30583 Guard 10 0 0
npc tanapi 30571 Trainer 20 0 0
npc tamil 30576 Gatekeeper 30 0 0

